### ============================================================
### AI Fit Campus - Endpoints del backend
### Usar con la extensión "REST Client" de VS Code (o en IntelliJ/WebStorm)
### Clic en "Send Request" encima de cada petición.
### ============================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000/api

# Pega aquí tu token (el que empieza por eyJ...), sin comillas
@token = PEGA_AQUI_TU_TOKEN


### ============================================================
### AUTENTICACIÓN
### ============================================================

### Iniciar sesión con Microsoft
# Ábrelo en el NAVEGADOR (no aquí): redirige al login de Microsoft
# y al terminar te devuelve el token en la URL (#token=...)
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/microsoft

### Usuario de la sesión actual (el dueño del token)
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### ============================================================
### USUARIOS
### ============================================================

### Listar / buscar usuarios
# search: nombre, correo o área   |   active=true: solo activos
GET {{baseUrl}}/users?search=&active=true
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Registrar usuario (lo hace el administrador)
POST {{baseUrl}}/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Ana",
  "lastName": "Gómez",
  "email": "ana.gomez@uniempresarial.edu.co",
  "roleId": 1,
  "programId": 1,
  "department": "Talento Humano",
  "officeLocation": "Sede principal"
}

### Actualizar mi perfil (solo el propio usuario)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/users/1/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Johan",
  "lastName": "Pérez",
  "mobilePhone": "3001234567",
  "jobTitle": "Desarrollador",
  "officeLocation": "Sede principal"
}

### Asignar área / departamento
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/users/2/department
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "department": "Sistemas",
  "officeLocation": "Bloque B"
}

### Actualizar permisos del usuario
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/users/2/permissions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "permissions": {
    "ejercicios": true,
    "reportes": false
  }
}

### Desactivar usuario
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/users/2/deactivate
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### ============================================================
### ROLES
### ============================================================

### Listar roles
GET {{baseUrl}}/roles
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Crear rol
POST {{baseUrl}}/roles
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Colaborador"
}

### Renombrar rol
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/roles/2
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Colaborador general"
}

### Eliminar rol (falla si tiene usuarios asignados)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/roles/2
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Asignar rol a un usuario
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/users/2/role
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roleId": 1
}


### ============================================================
### CATEGORÍAS DE EJERCICIOS
### ============================================================

### Listar categorías (active=true: solo activas)
GET {{baseUrl}}/exercise-categories?active=true
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Crear categoría
POST {{baseUrl}}/exercise-categories
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Estiramiento",
  "description": "Ejercicios para estirar cuello, espalda y brazos"
}

### Editar categoría (también sirve para reactivar: "isActive": true)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/exercise-categories/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Ejercicios de estiramiento para la jornada"
}

### Inactivar categoría (falla si tiene ejercicios activos)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/exercise-categories/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### ============================================================
### EJERCICIOS (por video)
### ============================================================

### Listar ejercicios
# search: nombre o descripción   |   categoryId: filtra por categoría   |   active=true: solo activos
GET {{baseUrl}}/exercises?search=&categoryId=&active=true
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Ver un ejercicio
GET {{baseUrl}}/exercises/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Crear ejercicio
POST {{baseUrl}}/exercises
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Estiramiento de cuello",
  "description": "Gira el cuello suavemente hacia ambos lados",
  "durationSeconds": 60,
  "resourceUrl": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=abc123",
  "categoryId": 1
}

### Editar ejercicio (también sirve para reactivar: "isActive": true)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/exercises/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "durationSeconds": 90,
  "resourceUrl": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nuevo456"
}

### Inactivar ejercicio
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/exercises/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### ============================================================
### INSIGNIAS (BADGES)
### ============================================================

### Listar insignias (active=true: solo activas)
GET {{baseUrl}}/badges?active=true
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Ver una insignia
GET {{baseUrl}}/badges/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Crear insignia
POST {{baseUrl}}/badges
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Constante",
  "description": "Completa 10 pausas activas",
  "condition": "pausas_completadas",
  "targetValue": 10
}

### Editar insignia (también sirve para reactivar: "isActive": true)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/badges/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "targetValue": 15
}

### Inactivar insignia
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/badges/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### ============================================================
### TIPOS DE RUTINA
### ============================================================

### Listar tipos de rutina (search: nombre o descripción | active=true: solo activos)
GET {{baseUrl}}/routine-types?search=&active=true
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Crear tipo de rutina
POST {{baseUrl}}/routine-types
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Oficina",
  "description": "Rutinas para hacer en el puesto de trabajo"
}

### Editar tipo de rutina (también sirve para reactivar: "isActive": true)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/routine-types/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Rutinas cortas para hacer sentado"
}

### Inactivar tipo de rutina (falla si tiene rutinas activas)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/routine-types/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### ============================================================
### RUTINAS
### ============================================================

### Listar rutinas
# search: nombre o descripción | routineTypeId: filtra por tipo | active=true: solo activas
GET {{baseUrl}}/routines?search=&routineTypeId=&active=true
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Ver una rutina con sus ejercicios
GET {{baseUrl}}/routines/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Crear rutina
# La duración total se calcula sola: duración del ejercicio × series + descanso
POST {{baseUrl}}/routines
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Pausa de 5 minutos",
  "description": "Estiramientos rápidos para la mitad de la jornada",
  "routineTypeId": 1,
  "exercises": [
    { "exerciseId": 1, "orderIndex": 1, "sets": 2, "reps": 10, "restSeconds": 15 },
    { "exerciseId": 2, "orderIndex": 2, "sets": 1, "restSeconds": 0 }
  ]
}

### Editar rutina
# Si envías "exercises", se reemplaza la lista completa y se recalcula la duración.
# Para reactivar una rutina inactiva: { "isActive": true }
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/routines/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Pausa activa de oficina",
  "exercises": [
    { "exerciseId": 2, "orderIndex": 1, "sets": 3 }
  ]
}

### Inactivar rutina
# Si alguien la hizo en los últimos 7 días, pide confirmación con ?confirm=true
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/routines/1?confirm=true
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### ============================================================
### REALIZAR RUTINAS E HISTORIAL (usuario de la sesión)
### ============================================================

### Registrar que hice una rutina
# Si durationSeconds >= duración total -> "completada" (100%); si no -> "abandonada" con su %
POST {{baseUrl}}/routines/1/execute
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "durationSeconds": 120
}

### Mi historial de rutinas
GET {{baseUrl}}/routines/history/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ============================================
### NOTIFICACIONES
### ============================================

### Crear notificación (Admin)
POST {{baseUrl}}/notifications
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Pausa activa matutina",
  "description": "Hora de realizar tu pausa activa",
  "routineId": 1,
  "notificationTime": "09:00",
  "reminder": true,
  "reminderMinutes": 5,
  "isActive": true,
  "days": [1, 2, 3, 4, 5]
}

### Obtener todas las notificaciones (Admin)
GET {{baseUrl}}/notifications
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Obtener notificaciones del usuario autenticado
GET {{baseUrl}}/notifications/my-notifications
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Obtener notificación por ID (Admin)
GET {{baseUrl}}/notifications/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Actualizar notificación (Admin)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/notifications/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Pausa activa matutina actualizada",
  "description": "Hora de realizar tu pausa activa",
  "routineId": 1,
  "notificationTime": "10:00",
  "reminder": true,
  "reminderMinutes": 10,
  "isActive": true,
  "days": [1, 3, 5]
}

### Activar/Desactivar notificación (Admin)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/notifications/1/toggle
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
